{"resourceIdentifier":"2938","resourceName":"Yunshui Wastewater Treatment Plant Project in Guangdong Province","description":"The project introduces aerobic wastewater treatment plant to treat wastewater from towns in many regions of Guangdong Province, there are 16 wastewater plants, each using the same treatment process (A2O+MBR). The whole aerobic process includes pre-treatment process, secondary biological treatment process, tertiary deep treatment process and sludge treatment process, with an total maximum design influent flow of 175,150 m3/d and the effluent COD concentration is 40 mg/L. The wastewater is composed of residents' domestic wastewater within the service area. The project can reduce environmental pollution and destroy methane emissions from the open anaerobic lagoons in baseline scenario, the best available low-cost solution for wastewater treatment.","location":{"latitude":20.448619,"longitude":110.111337},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-04-05","endExclusive":"2022-05-06","endInclusive":"2022-05-05"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2938"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Yunshui Guangdong Environmental Protection Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"DanyuHuang520@163.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2938"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"83042"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0080"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"09